{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/f2dd205b9578c74b83f0a77fecf03766.avif?t=1774180810\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nullis</strong> is a puzzle game where the goal is to clear the board from zeros while gravity and qubits add challenge. Select non-crossing paths of 0-s, destory them and create new paths, until all are gone.  Plan your moves ahead to complete levels with optimal solutions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/581c5ae4cd361c1c9b73ae02d64f3223.poster.avif?t=1774180810\" width=340 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/581c5ae4cd361c1c9b73ae02d64f3223.webm?t=1774180810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/581c5ae4cd361c1c9b73ae02d64f3223.mp4?t=1774180810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/c7b03381942c3d17a6e359fea5b40005.avif?t=1774180810\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player logic puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure - choose between three difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quantum Qubits with different abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret levels with unique patterns (there is a FROG...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique solutions to complete levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/510549747e882bf1ff295d1abed34f97.avif?t=1774180810\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes over 100 handcrafted levels across <strong>three different difficulties </strong>+\u00a0secret levels. Complete each level with optimal amount of moves to earn stars or just click around and be lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/40bac45e088360f05fef45bc8aef689c.poster.avif?t=1774180810\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/40bac45e088360f05fef45bc8aef689c.webm?t=1774180810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952000/extras/40bac45e088360f05fef45bc8aef689c.mp4?t=1774180810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are different kinds of symbols:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0 - must be destroyed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 - can never be destroyed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qubits - different behaviors, like time-sensitive explosions.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Open the Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952000/4d4a998a7659ef3d160fd0e29ac79697642d82cf.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Regular Levels (1 star)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952000/0fc84a8d520c1160cc8480f73fd07e26cafe77a3.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Medium Levels (1 star)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.